1
00:00:28,867 --> 00:00:31,007
<i>Lands which I've yet to see...</i>

2
00:00:32,207 --> 00:00:34,467
<i>Races who I’ve yet to meet...</i>

3
00:00:43,307 --> 00:00:45,107
<i>A tomorrow which I’ve yet to experience...</i>

4
00:00:46,307 --> 00:00:48,847
<i>No matter what happens,</i>

5
00:00:49,557 --> 00:00:51,057
<i>I...</i>

6
00:00:53,957 --> 00:00:56,157
<i>will change the world!</i>

7
00:01:11,257 --> 00:01:14,857
<i>Here lies the land where Sinbad conquered the Dungeon.</i>

8
00:01:15,357 --> 00:01:22,147
<i>By doing so, he began his quest to find mysterious warriors across the world.</i>

9
00:01:22,757 --> 00:01:28,257
<i>Thus as many predicted, Dungeons began appearing throughout the lands.</i>

10
00:01:28,257 --> 00:01:31,857
<i>In short, the Era of Dungeon Conquerors has begun.</i>

11
00:01:35,617 --> 00:01:39,037
Magi: Sinbad no Bouken ・ Part 1

12
00:01:42,007 --> 00:01:45,707
<i>And so, Sinbad the Conqueror is now…</i>

13
00:01:51,057 --> 00:01:52,737
<i>drifting.</i>

14
00:02:01,507 --> 00:02:03,707
Big Bro!

15
00:02:03,707 --> 00:02:06,257
This is your final chance! This time, for sure!

16
00:02:08,857 --> 00:02:10,177
From below?!

17
00:02:30,777 --> 00:02:32,047
Damn it!

18
00:02:39,957 --> 00:02:41,957
It's going to catch up.

19
00:02:52,207 --> 00:02:53,557
This way!

20
00:02:54,807 --> 00:02:56,437
If I don’t take him down here,

21
00:02:56,777 --> 00:02:58,707
I won’t reach adulthood.

22
00:02:58,707 --> 00:03:04,757
I’ll kill him… with the one shot I have!

23
00:03:07,207 --> 00:03:08,457
No more…

24
00:03:08,507 --> 00:03:10,507
Staying like this…

25
00:03:11,457 --> 00:03:15,007
I don’t want that!

26
00:03:36,257 --> 00:03:38,147
Over here, you monster!

27
00:03:39,957 --> 00:03:40,957
Baal!

28
00:03:41,557 --> 00:03:43,907
Lend me your power!

29
00:03:46,857 --> 00:03:49,507
Fall, Thunder!

30
00:04:04,007 --> 00:04:06,807
S-So cold…

31
00:04:13,407 --> 00:04:14,707
Iceberg up ahead!

32
00:04:14,957 --> 00:04:16,767
What a major setback!

33
00:04:16,767 --> 00:04:20,557
With the number of icebergs emerging, we should reduce our speed.

34
00:04:20,557 --> 00:04:21,157
No.

35
00:04:21,557 --> 00:04:22,907
Continue full speed ahead.

36
00:04:25,807 --> 00:04:27,287
<i>You summoned me?</i>

37
00:04:27,287 --> 00:04:29,287
<i>Dragul.</i>

38
00:04:29,487 --> 00:04:34,547
<i>His Majesty is enraged by the matter concerning the Dungeon.</i>

39
00:04:34,547 --> 00:04:39,757
<i>Also, Serendine-sama has been shamed thanks to Sinbad.</i>

40
00:04:41,007 --> 00:04:44,857
<i>Normally, you would have been stripped of your military position.</i>

41
00:04:45,207 --> 00:04:51,707
<i>However, Safu General Barbarossa-sama has ensured that His Majesty give you at least the rank of a watchdog.</i>

42
00:04:51,707 --> 00:04:52,707
<i>Big Brother has…</i>

43
00:04:59,607 --> 00:05:04,687
<i>Partevia’s pride, the assassins of Sham Lash.</i>

44
00:05:05,207 --> 00:05:11,007
<i>Take these men with you and deliver Sinbad’s vessel to His Majesty.</i>

45
00:05:16,007 --> 00:05:19,857
<i>Furthermore, about Sinbad’s whereabouts...</i>

46
00:05:20,857 --> 00:05:23,877
<i>He heads northward.</i>

47
00:05:24,527 --> 00:05:27,577
<i>You are forbidden to fail again. Now go!</i>

48
00:05:27,857 --> 00:05:29,657
<i>I will stake my very life on it.</i>

49
00:05:32,107 --> 00:05:33,537
If we move forward like this,

50
00:05:34,107 --> 00:05:36,387
we’ll arrive at Imuchakk.

51
00:05:37,207 --> 00:05:41,397
A remote region, home to a savage race of ill repute.

52
00:05:42,357 --> 00:05:43,957
Is he there?

53
00:05:57,057 --> 00:06:00,357
Woah, it really is huge!

54
00:06:01,157 --> 00:06:03,107
It’s called a Rampaging Unicorn.

55
00:06:03,557 --> 00:06:05,757
They usually live in the Southern seas

56
00:06:05,957 --> 00:06:09,257
but occasionally travel all the way up here.

57
00:06:09,957 --> 00:06:11,357
That’s amazing.

58
00:06:11,357 --> 00:06:14,257
And to think that you were trying to defeat it with one shot!

59
00:06:16,747 --> 00:06:17,847
Big Bro…

60
00:06:17,847 --> 00:06:19,507
You finally did it?

61
00:06:22,387 --> 00:06:23,697
You really did it!

62
00:06:25,007 --> 00:06:27,107
I knew you were better at more than just swimming!

63
00:06:27,107 --> 00:06:29,107
That's my Big Bro!

64
00:06:29,107 --> 00:06:30,297
Alright!

65
00:06:31,197 --> 00:06:33,427
Damn, I wanted to see it.

66
00:06:33,427 --> 00:06:35,427
But why is it burnt?

67
00:06:36,757 --> 00:06:37,697
And who are you?

68
00:06:38,407 --> 00:06:39,377
Me?

69
00:06:40,007 --> 00:06:41,357
I’m Sinbad.

70
00:06:41,757 --> 00:06:44,837
A woman’s beauty sure travels around the world, doesn't it?

71
00:06:51,657 --> 00:06:52,657
What’s your name?

72
00:06:52,857 --> 00:06:54,137
I’m Pipirika.

73
00:06:54,137 --> 00:06:56,137
Nice to meet you, Pipirika.

74
00:06:56,457 --> 00:06:57,457
And um…

75
00:06:57,457 --> 00:07:00,017
Come to think of it, I haven’t asked your name, have I?

76
00:07:02,957 --> 00:07:03,557
Hina.

77
00:07:03,857 --> 00:07:05,177
He’s called Hina.

78
00:07:06,007 --> 00:07:08,057
Big Bro is already 21 years old,

79
00:07:08,057 --> 00:07:09,797
but he still only has his given name.

80
00:07:09,797 --> 00:07:12,597
But now that you've defeated the Rampaging Unicorn,

81
00:07:12,597 --> 00:07:14,987
you’ll finally get a warrior’s name!

82
00:07:16,287 --> 00:07:18,957
With this, that person will acknowledge you too.

83
00:07:18,957 --> 00:07:19,957
That person?

84
00:07:20,657 --> 00:07:23,657
Strong, sweet… all women including myself admire her.

85
00:07:23,657 --> 00:07:27,107
After all, she’s Imuchakk’s number one beauty.

86
00:07:27,107 --> 00:07:28,187
Wow!

87
00:07:31,267 --> 00:07:33,957
What kind of a place is Imuchakk?

88
00:07:34,157 --> 00:07:36,487
What kind? Let’s see…

89
00:07:36,487 --> 00:07:38,187
It’s completely white.

90
00:07:38,187 --> 00:07:39,477
I don’t mean it like that…

91
00:07:39,477 --> 00:07:40,477
More like…

92
00:07:40,477 --> 00:07:42,837
What kind of leader does it have and such?

93
00:07:42,837 --> 00:07:45,187
Our father is the chief.

94
00:07:45,187 --> 00:07:45,987
Really?!

95
00:07:46,287 --> 00:07:49,887
Great! Take me there too.

96
00:07:50,257 --> 00:07:51,557
Sinbad…

97
00:07:51,787 --> 00:07:54,787
Our people don’t allow outsiders among us.

98
00:07:55,257 --> 00:07:57,477
I don’t think a lot of good will come of your visit.

99
00:07:57,477 --> 00:07:58,477
I don’t mind.

100
00:07:59,457 --> 00:08:00,457
Unknown lands...

101
00:08:00,857 --> 00:08:02,127
Unfamiliar people…

102
00:08:02,657 --> 00:08:04,757
I want to see the entire world…

103
00:08:05,257 --> 00:08:06,957
in order to change it!

104
00:08:15,057 --> 00:08:15,957
I…

105
00:08:17,107 --> 00:08:18,237
It’s beautiful, isn’t it?

106
00:08:20,657 --> 00:08:22,647
You've been gazing at this scene the entire time?

107
00:08:24,677 --> 00:08:25,397
Yes.

108
00:08:29,557 --> 00:08:30,657
I’m sorry.

109
00:08:32,187 --> 00:08:33,437
The Rampaging Unicorn.

110
00:08:33,607 --> 00:08:35,157
I stole your thunder.

111
00:08:36,407 --> 00:08:37,477
But you…

112
00:08:37,477 --> 00:08:39,757
You saved your little sister in an instant, didn’t you?

113
00:08:41,477 --> 00:08:42,737
That was cool.

114
00:08:46,457 --> 00:08:47,957
Was it?

115
00:08:53,587 --> 00:08:55,587
Pure white lands...

116
00:08:56,277 --> 00:08:57,857
A race that dwells in the Poles...

117
00:08:58,127 --> 00:08:59,977
Strange homes…

118
00:08:59,977 --> 00:09:02,977
And beautiful ladies too!

119
00:09:05,107 --> 00:09:07,787
Imuchakk is a country of snow and ice.

120
00:09:08,037 --> 00:09:10,017
Welcome back to you both,

121
00:09:12,857 --> 00:09:14,527
my children.

122
00:09:14,857 --> 00:09:16,057
Father!

123
00:09:16,927 --> 00:09:18,797
We have returned.

124
00:09:20,177 --> 00:09:21,627
And who are you?

125
00:09:21,627 --> 00:09:23,287
I’m Sinbad.

126
00:09:23,777 --> 00:09:26,157
I’m on an adventure to see the world—

127
00:09:27,327 --> 00:09:28,857
This is Imuchakk.

128
00:09:29,277 --> 00:09:31,427
This is no place for outsiders!

129
00:09:31,427 --> 00:09:32,387
Father…

130
00:09:32,937 --> 00:09:34,737
Sinbad is our—

131
00:09:34,737 --> 00:09:38,747
My son, now you’ve finally become a warrior.

132
00:09:39,087 --> 00:09:40,677
From this moment forward,

133
00:09:40,677 --> 00:09:43,787
this clan—this village—needs your protection from enemies.

134
00:09:45,637 --> 00:09:46,817
Remember that.

135
00:09:48,127 --> 00:09:48,857
Yes…

136
00:09:50,877 --> 00:09:53,057
Tonight will be the Maharagan!

137
00:09:53,057 --> 00:09:55,497
Come, it is time to prepare for the festival!

138
00:09:58,677 --> 00:09:59,177
Now then…

139
00:10:00,637 --> 00:10:03,757
Sinbad has entered the village of Imuchakk.

140
00:10:03,757 --> 00:10:04,917
This has become rather troublesome.

141
00:10:05,207 --> 00:10:08,637
The people of Sham Lash have already begun to take action.

142
00:10:09,937 --> 00:10:11,167
Doing as they please!

143
00:10:11,657 --> 00:10:13,957
They are people of darkness.

144
00:10:14,227 --> 00:10:16,177
You can’t tame them.

145
00:10:16,957 --> 00:10:18,677
Also...

146
00:10:25,207 --> 00:10:27,187
What’s a Maharagan?

147
00:10:27,557 --> 00:10:30,727
It’s a traditional Imuchakk festival.

148
00:10:30,727 --> 00:10:36,857
It used to be a coming-of-age ceremony to receive a warrior’s name and rank

149
00:10:36,857 --> 00:10:40,757
and also a ritual to thank the Goddess of the Sea.

150
00:10:40,757 --> 00:10:42,827
Now that you’ve defeated the Rampaging Unicorn, Big Bro,

151
00:10:42,827 --> 00:10:44,157
along with having your name,

152
00:10:44,157 --> 00:10:45,877
you’ll become a real warrior!

153
00:10:46,937 --> 00:10:49,827
In truth, during the time you two were gone,

154
00:10:49,827 --> 00:10:52,237
strange things appeared.

155
00:10:52,637 --> 00:10:53,787
Strange things?

156
00:10:54,437 --> 00:10:59,697
A building which I have never seen before has appeared farther up north.

157
00:10:59,697 --> 00:11:03,697
It’s the perfect place to choose new warriors.

158
00:11:04,307 --> 00:11:06,807
Hina, you shall also go and conquer—

159
00:11:06,807 --> 00:11:07,847
You can’t!

160
00:11:08,787 --> 00:11:10,787
You can’t get close to that.

161
00:11:10,977 --> 00:11:11,777
What?

162
00:11:12,097 --> 00:11:13,757
That’s a Dungeon.

163
00:11:14,307 --> 00:11:16,207
In my country Partevia,

164
00:11:16,207 --> 00:11:19,617
a building like that appeared as well and many people died.

165
00:11:19,907 --> 00:11:20,907
I’ve heard of it too.

166
00:11:20,907 --> 00:11:25,567
All the soldiers who entered were annihilated

167
00:11:25,567 --> 00:11:28,627
and it was eventually conquered by a single young man.

168
00:11:30,007 --> 00:11:31,107
That was me.

169
00:11:33,007 --> 00:11:34,777
What are you trying to say?

170
00:11:34,777 --> 00:11:38,127
I won’t forgive anyone who makes a fool of us.

171
00:11:46,207 --> 00:11:49,557
Is that what they call a Conqueror's Sign?

172
00:11:49,877 --> 00:11:51,457
Yes, that's right.

173
00:11:51,787 --> 00:11:54,107
The Djinn of that Dungeon resides in it.

174
00:11:58,477 --> 00:12:03,717
It is customary in Imachakk to ensure that the strong receive the finest hospitality.

175
00:12:03,717 --> 00:12:05,827
Please forgive my rude behavior up until now.

176
00:12:14,837 --> 00:12:17,257
It’s only natural to be wary of strangers.

177
00:12:17,637 --> 00:12:21,967
All the more when you’re the chief who looks out for his entire clan.

178
00:12:22,977 --> 00:12:24,817
That’s why I’d like to make a request.

179
00:12:25,307 --> 00:12:28,107
Don’t allow anyone close to that Dungeon.

180
00:12:28,357 --> 00:12:29,507
I understand.

181
00:12:29,507 --> 00:12:30,977
You have my word.

182
00:12:31,207 --> 00:12:34,997
Oh. Big Bro, have you already spoken with that person?

183
00:12:35,577 --> 00:12:36,977
No, I’m…

184
00:12:37,357 --> 00:12:39,507
You’re a warrior now.

185
00:12:39,507 --> 00:12:40,737
You should quickly tell that person too.

186
00:12:40,737 --> 00:12:41,737
Stop it!

187
00:12:41,997 --> 00:12:43,497
Right now, a person like me…

188
00:12:43,807 --> 00:12:45,987
Big Bro, what’s wrong?

189
00:12:46,387 --> 00:12:47,367
It’s started!

190
00:12:47,367 --> 00:12:48,417
Hurry!

191
00:12:51,257 --> 00:12:53,807
Come! Now is the time for the Maharagan,

192
00:12:53,807 --> 00:12:58,097
the celebration of a man becoming a warrior and time to show our thanks to the Goddess of the Sea.

193
00:13:28,857 --> 00:13:30,977
<i>Now that you’ve defeated the Rampaging Unicorn, Big Bro,</i>

194
00:13:30,977 --> 00:13:32,357
<i>along with having your name,</i>

195
00:13:32,357 --> 00:13:34,577
<i>you’ll become a real warrior!</i>

196
00:13:35,707 --> 00:13:36,837
<i>You’re wrong.</i>

197
00:13:36,837 --> 00:13:39,727
<i>I heard he ran away from the Rampaging Unicorn again.</i>

198
00:13:39,727 --> 00:13:44,037
<i>I’m sorry. I can’t go out with a man who isn’t a warrior.</i>

199
00:13:44,037 --> 00:13:47,267
<i>What, did you fail again?</i>

200
00:13:47,267 --> 00:13:50,277
<i>You will become a warrior. You’re the Chief’s son, aren’t you?</i>

201
00:13:50,277 --> 00:13:52,877
<i>You can definitely defeat it, Big Brother!</i>

202
00:13:53,857 --> 00:13:54,857
<i>My son.</i>

203
00:13:54,857 --> 00:13:56,977
<i>Hurry and become a warrior.</i>

204
00:13:58,677 --> 00:13:59,877
I…

205
00:14:00,677 --> 00:14:01,707
Big Bro.

206
00:14:02,797 --> 00:14:06,567
You always come here when you have something on your mind, don't you?

207
00:14:09,657 --> 00:14:11,357
This sure brings back memories.

208
00:14:12,557 --> 00:14:14,857
<i>Wow, that’s so good!</i>

209
00:14:15,557 --> 00:14:17,107
<i>Pipirika, you wanna give it a go?</i>

210
00:14:17,457 --> 00:14:18,657
<i>I’m fine.</i>

211
00:14:18,857 --> 00:14:20,757
<i>You’ll get better once you practice.</i>

212
00:14:20,757 --> 00:14:22,517
<i>I can teach you.</i>

213
00:14:22,517 --> 00:14:24,107
<i>Okay!</i>

214
00:14:24,107 --> 00:14:27,457
<i>But you know, I want to watch you do it, Big Bro!</i>

215
00:14:28,357 --> 00:14:29,377
<i>Sure.</i>

216
00:14:30,787 --> 00:14:32,487
Now that you’re a warrior,

217
00:14:32,487 --> 00:14:35,397
you must have a lot on your mind.

218
00:14:36,107 --> 00:14:36,887
But you know,

219
00:14:37,357 --> 00:14:41,777
even though you're a warrior, you'll always be the same kindhearted Big Bro, right?

220
00:14:42,557 --> 00:14:43,357
Let’s go.

221
00:14:43,657 --> 00:14:45,657
Tonight is your festival.

222
00:14:45,987 --> 00:14:47,027
Right.

223
00:14:47,027 --> 00:14:47,697
Come on!

224
00:14:48,557 --> 00:14:52,107
If we don’t hurry, Father will get Sinbad drunk!

225
00:14:59,357 --> 00:15:01,717
Huh? Where’s Sinbad?

226
00:15:02,157 --> 00:15:06,157
His threshold for alcohol is low so he’s resting now.

227
00:15:06,157 --> 00:15:08,557
You gave him too much to drink, didn’t you?

228
00:15:08,557 --> 00:15:10,277
What are you saying?

229
00:15:10,277 --> 00:15:13,187
If a man can’t hold his alcohol, then what will become of him?

230
00:15:14,807 --> 00:15:15,957
What’s wrong?

231
00:15:16,407 --> 00:15:17,317
Can you take it?

232
00:15:17,887 --> 00:15:20,557
This is a special sort of brew, you know.

233
00:15:25,557 --> 00:15:27,557
You’re so beautiful…

234
00:15:28,407 --> 00:15:30,107
But hang on…

235
00:15:30,807 --> 00:15:31,487
So tall…

236
00:15:31,487 --> 00:15:33,627
<i>That’s our target.</i>

237
00:15:33,627 --> 00:15:36,627
Ah, wait…

238
00:15:36,627 --> 00:15:38,627
<i>Piece of cake.</i>

239
00:15:39,377 --> 00:15:40,277
<i>Die!</i>

240
00:15:41,457 --> 00:15:43,457
Wait!

241
00:15:51,987 --> 00:15:52,987
A kid?

242
00:15:54,307 --> 00:15:57,307
Naughty children need to be disciplined properly!

243
00:16:04,857 --> 00:16:06,357
Is that all?

244
00:16:06,357 --> 00:16:09,257
As I thought, I’m more than enough to finish the job.

245
00:16:10,777 --> 00:16:11,577
What?

246
00:16:11,857 --> 00:16:13,457
What are you smiling about?

247
00:16:13,807 --> 00:16:15,387
Too bad.

248
00:16:25,007 --> 00:16:26,417
Now then.

249
00:16:26,807 --> 00:16:28,357
Who are you?

250
00:16:28,707 --> 00:16:30,237
Are you a member of Partevia’s troops?

251
00:16:31,107 --> 00:16:32,257
This brat!

252
00:16:32,857 --> 00:16:35,857
To think they would involve even a kid like you.

253
00:16:37,257 --> 00:16:38,047
Hey!

254
00:16:38,357 --> 00:16:39,807
What’s with that attitude?

255
00:16:40,407 --> 00:16:42,107
And at your age on top of that.

256
00:16:42,407 --> 00:16:44,207
I don’t know who your superiors are

257
00:16:44,427 --> 00:16:45,907
but your parents will be sad, won’t they?

258
00:16:46,007 --> 00:16:47,007
Shut up.

259
00:16:47,307 --> 00:16:48,307
What did you say?

260
00:16:48,857 --> 00:16:51,657
That’s some attitude towards people older than you.

261
00:16:51,657 --> 00:16:56,057
Sinbad, he’s an assassin. Be careful.

262
00:16:56,057 --> 00:16:57,187
I know.

263
00:16:57,337 --> 00:17:00,457
That’s why I’m asking him firsthand, right?

264
00:17:01,437 --> 00:17:03,377
N-No, that’s not what I meant…

265
00:17:03,377 --> 00:17:07,657
No. You gotta teach brats like him everything from the basics.

266
00:17:08,287 --> 00:17:09,217
You got that?

267
00:17:09,827 --> 00:17:13,487
You think you can talk like that just because you’re an assassin?

268
00:17:14,157 --> 00:17:16,907
Don’t you think your mom and dad will be disappointed?

269
00:17:17,257 --> 00:17:19,217
That’s why I told you to shut up!

270
00:17:19,467 --> 00:17:21,467
My parents are long gone!

271
00:17:21,467 --> 00:17:24,067
I killed them when I was six after all!

272
00:17:25,857 --> 00:17:28,517
What? You scared now?

273
00:17:30,657 --> 00:17:33,287
Don’t you dare say such things so proudly.

274
00:17:35,507 --> 00:17:36,507
I pity you.

275
00:17:44,037 --> 00:17:44,937
What’s with you?

276
00:17:45,207 --> 00:17:46,407
Those eyes…

277
00:17:46,887 --> 00:17:50,587
You’re a kid yourself, you asshole!

278
00:17:53,587 --> 00:17:54,587
Sinbad!

279
00:17:54,587 --> 00:17:55,487
You little…!

280
00:17:58,427 --> 00:17:59,677
Don’t come any closer!

281
00:18:01,437 --> 00:18:03,317
As if you could understand...

282
00:18:10,257 --> 00:18:12,737
Chief, are you unharmed?

283
00:18:12,737 --> 00:18:13,737
Shut up!

284
00:18:16,597 --> 00:18:19,387
I’ll definitely kill you!

285
00:18:19,387 --> 00:18:21,907
Sinbad!

286
00:18:22,357 --> 00:18:24,257
Just who were those guys…

287
00:18:24,807 --> 00:18:26,627
Is that wound you got okay?

288
00:18:26,627 --> 00:18:28,417
It’s nothing serious.

289
00:18:28,787 --> 00:18:31,327
Come on, let's hurry and get ready for the festival.

290
00:18:31,327 --> 00:18:34,007
More importantly, who were those guys?

291
00:18:34,007 --> 00:18:36,357
Probably some people from the Partevian Army.

292
00:18:36,357 --> 00:18:38,017
They’re after me.

293
00:18:38,017 --> 00:18:41,407
Isn’t that something you shouldn’t take lightly?

294
00:18:41,407 --> 00:18:42,257
Why?

295
00:18:42,257 --> 00:18:44,407
Because I defied the country.

296
00:18:44,407 --> 00:18:45,967
And some other stuff.

297
00:18:46,407 --> 00:18:48,007
Aren’t you afraid?

298
00:18:48,557 --> 00:18:51,357
You can’t return to your country and your life is being targeted.

299
00:18:51,357 --> 00:18:54,047
This could last for the rest of your life, you know.

300
00:18:54,047 --> 00:18:55,007
For me,

301
00:18:55,357 --> 00:18:57,457
I only follow my own destiny. That's it.

302
00:18:58,707 --> 00:18:59,657
Also,

303
00:19:00,107 --> 00:19:02,527
I will overcome this wave.

304
00:19:05,727 --> 00:19:06,357
Sin…

305
00:19:09,007 --> 00:19:10,007
I…

306
00:19:11,377 --> 00:19:13,277
Just a little bit more!

307
00:19:13,677 --> 00:19:16,007
Big Bro, it’s time!

308
00:19:17,457 --> 00:19:19,057
Could you go on ahead before me?

309
00:19:19,657 --> 00:19:22,677
I’d like to calm down for a bit.

310
00:19:23,757 --> 00:19:24,897
I see.

311
00:19:24,897 --> 00:19:26,087
Come as soon as you can, okay?

312
00:19:26,087 --> 00:19:27,687
We’ll see you later.

313
00:19:34,757 --> 00:19:36,937
Come on, hurry up! We’ll be late!

314
00:19:37,977 --> 00:19:39,277
Sinbad!

315
00:19:41,977 --> 00:19:42,977
Big Bro has…

316
00:19:44,757 --> 00:19:45,807
Big Bro…

317
00:19:45,807 --> 00:19:48,577
In order to be a real warrior…

318
00:19:49,007 --> 00:19:51,007
He said he’s going to the Dungeon!

319
00:19:52,307 --> 00:19:53,637
<i>Will I become a warrior?</i>

320
00:19:54,307 --> 00:19:56,857
<i>If I obtain the power of the Dungeon,</i>

321
00:19:57,357 --> 00:19:59,457
<i>I’ll be just like you.</i>

322
00:20:03,587 --> 00:20:06,677
Everyone except one who wants to be king will be slaughtered.

323
00:20:06,677 --> 00:20:07,987
That’s how the Dungeon works.

324
00:20:08,857 --> 00:20:11,957
To achieve their ambitions, many men tried

325
00:20:11,957 --> 00:20:14,017
and died in the process.

326
00:20:14,657 --> 00:20:16,457
Then, Big Bro…

327
00:20:16,757 --> 00:20:17,757
Don’t worry.

328
00:20:18,187 --> 00:20:20,247
I won’t let Hina die.

329
00:20:20,657 --> 00:20:21,457
But!

330
00:20:21,807 --> 00:20:24,807
Whether you come back alive or not…

331
00:20:24,807 --> 00:20:27,007
We can't be certain of that, right?

332
00:20:28,607 --> 00:20:29,937
I know this:

333
00:20:32,257 --> 00:20:35,207
I will not die.

334
00:20:48,357 --> 00:20:49,257
This is…

335
00:20:57,257 --> 00:20:58,357
Don’t lose heart.

336
00:20:59,057 --> 00:21:00,257
Even I…

337
00:21:03,657 --> 00:21:05,977
If I obtain the power of the Dungeon,

338
00:21:05,977 --> 00:21:08,137
then I’ll finally become a warrior.

339
00:21:08,427 --> 00:21:10,737
I will have everyone acknowledge me.

340
00:21:14,937 --> 00:21:16,237
This is…

341
00:21:22,677 --> 00:21:23,677
Where am I?

342
00:21:32,857 --> 00:21:34,487
This is…

343
00:21:35,687 --> 00:21:37,727
A Dungeon?

344
00:21:48,357 --> 00:21:53,487
Have your travels been led by the Dungeons, Sinbad?

345
00:21:54,757 --> 00:21:59,747
What do your eyes see all the way up there?

346
00:23:36,677 --> 00:23:38,387
Sinbad…

347
00:23:38,857 --> 00:23:41,457
Is this your fate?

348
00:23:41,827 --> 00:23:42,827
I’ll do it.

349
00:23:44,657 --> 00:23:48,537
I won’t… let anyone interfere.

